 "title": "Ring Mod Atmosphere",
 "category": "Pads and atmospheres",
 "text": "Sound: an eerie, unsettled, shifting drone: tones that never quite agree, drifting in and out of strange harmonies. The tension under a horror or sci-fi scene.\n\nHow it's built: two sines multiplied in a Ring Mod; a very slow LFO moves the second one's pitch (FM), so the sum and difference tones keep sliding against each other. Slow attack, Chorus and a big Reverb. Four voices.\n\nPlay: single held notes and odd intervals.\n\nTweak: the LFO's RATE, the second oscillator's FM and TUNE, the ring mod's MIX.",
